OL,3,AHeathrow Airport train services resume
OL,4,Aafter trackside fire disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an update on Sunday morning, rail
OL,7,Foperators said the fire had been
OL,8,Fextinguished and normal services had
OL,9,Fresumed.
